																								<script type="text/javascript">
							var StoreDefaults = {"PartnerEventStore":[{"gid":"706660627797511163","clan_steamid":"103582791475475174","event_name":"A month after the EA release \u2014 what's done and what's next \ud83c\udf3e","event_type":28,"appid":4301110,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1792684740,"rtime32_end_time":1792687140,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"Steam Cloud, Discord, a new routing grid, and plans for the upcoming updates\",\"Steam Cloud, Discord, ein neues Routennetz und Pl\u00e4ne f\u00fcr die n\u00e4chsten Updates\",\"Steam Cloud, Discord, un nouveau r\u00e9seau d'itin\u00e9raires et les plans pour les prochaines mises \u00e0 jour\",\"Steam Cloud, Discord, una nuova rete di percorsi e i piani per i prossimi aggiornamenti\",null,\"Steam Cloud, Discord, una nueva red de rutas y los planes para las pr\u00f3ximas actualizaciones\",null,null,null,null,null,\"Steam Cloud, Discord, uma nova rede de rotas e os planos para as pr\u00f3ximas atualiza\u00e7\u00f5es\",\"Steam Cloud, Discord, nowa siatka tras i plany na najbli\u017csze aktualizacje\",null,null,null,null,null,\"Steam Cloud, Discord, \u00faj \u00fatvonalh\u00e1l\u00f3 \u00e9s tervek a k\u00f6zelg\u0151 friss\u00edt\u00e9sekhez\",\"Steam Cloud, Discord, nov\u00e1 s\u00ed\u0165 tras a pl\u00e1ny na nejbli\u017e\u0161\u00ed aktualizace\",\"Steam Cloud, Discord, o nou\u0103 re\u021bea de rute \u0219i planurile pentru actualiz\u0103rile urm\u0103toare\",\"Steam Cloud, Discord, yeni rota a\u011f\u0131 ve yakla\u015fan g\u00fcncellemelere dair planlar\",null,null,null,null,\"Steam Cloud, Discord, \u043d\u043e\u0432\u0430 \u043c\u0430\u0440\u0448\u0440\u0443\u0442\u043d\u0430 \u0441\u0456\u0442\u043a\u0430 \u0456 \u043f\u043b\u0430\u043d\u0438 \u043d\u0430 \u043d\u0430\u0439\u0431\u043b\u0438\u0436\u0447\u0456 \u043e\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044f\",\"Steam Cloud, Discord, una nueva red de rutas y los planes para las pr\u00f3ximas actualizaciones\",null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[\"It's been a month since the Early Access release: here's what's been fixed, what I'm working on now, and what's coming in the big technical and story updates.\",\"Ein Monat seit dem Early-Access-Release: Ich erz\u00e4hle, was behoben wurde, woran ich gerade arbeite und was im gro\u00dfen Technik- und Story-Update kommt.\",\"Un mois depuis la sortie en acc\u00e8s anticip\u00e9 : je raconte ce qui a \u00e9t\u00e9 corrig\u00e9, ce sur quoi je travaille et ce qui arrive dans les grosses mises \u00e0 jour technique et sc\u00e9naristique.\",\"\u00c8 passato un mese dall'uscita in accesso anticipato: racconto cosa \u00e8 stato sistemato, a cosa sto lavorando e cosa arriver\u00e0 nei grandi aggiornamenti tecnico e narrativo.\",null,\"Ha pasado un mes desde el lanzamiento en acceso anticipado: cuento qu\u00e9 se ha arreglado, en qu\u00e9 estoy trabajando y qu\u00e9 llegar\u00e1 en las grandes actualizaciones t\u00e9cnica y de historia.\",null,null,null,null,null,\"Passou um m\u00eas desde o lan\u00e7amento em acesso antecipado: conto o que foi corrigido, no que estou a trabalhar e o que vem nas grandes atualiza\u00e7\u00f5es t\u00e9cnica e de hist\u00f3ria.\",\"Min\u0105\u0142 miesi\u0105c od premiery we wczesnym dost\u0119pie: opowiadam, co poprawione, nad czym pracuj\u0119 teraz i co b\u0119dzie w du\u017cej aktualizacji technicznej i fabularnej.\",null,null,null,null,null,\"Eltelt egy h\u00f3nap a korai hozz\u00e1f\u00e9r\u00e9s\u0171 megjelen\u00e9s \u00f3ta: elmes\u00e9lem, mi lett kijav\u00edtva, min dolgozom most, \u00e9s mi j\u00f6n a nagy technikai \u00e9s t\u00f6rt\u00e9neti friss\u00edt\u00e9sben.\",\"Uplynul m\u011bs\u00edc od vyd\u00e1n\u00ed v p\u0159edb\u011b\u017en\u00e9m p\u0159\u00edstupu: p\u00ed\u0161u, co je opraven\u00e9, na \u010dem pracuju te\u010f a co p\u0159inese velk\u00e1 technick\u00e1 a p\u0159\u00edb\u011bhov\u00e1 aktualizace.\",\"A trecut o lun\u0103 de la lansarea \u00een acces timpuriu: povestesc ce s-a reparat, la ce lucrez acum \u0219i ce va fi \u00een marile actualiz\u0103ri tehnic\u0103 \u0219i de poveste.\",\"Erken eri\u015fim \u00e7\u0131k\u0131\u015f\u0131ndan bu yana bir ay ge\u00e7ti: neler d\u00fczeltildi, \u015fu an ne \u00fczerinde \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yorum ve b\u00fcy\u00fck teknik ve hik\u00e2ye g\u00fcncellemelerinde neler olacak \u2014 hepsini anlat\u0131yorum.\",null,null,null,null,\"\u041c\u0438\u043d\u0443\u0432 \u043c\u0456\u0441\u044f\u0446\u044c \u0437 \u0440\u0435\u043b\u0456\u0437\u0443 \u0443 \u0434\u043e\u0447\u0430\u0441\u043d\u043e\u043c\u0443 \u0434\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0443\u043f\u0456: \u0440\u043e\u0437\u043f\u043e\u0432\u0456\u0434\u0430\u044e, \u0449\u043e \u0432\u0438\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u043e, \u043d\u0430\u0434 \u0447\u0438\u043c \u043f\u0440\u0430\u0446\u044e\u044e \u0437\u0430\u0440\u0430\u0437 \u0456 \u0449\u043e \u0431\u0443\u0434\u0435 \u0443 \u0432\u0435\u043b\u0438\u043a\u043e\u043c\u0443 \u0442\u0435\u0445\u043d\u0456\u0447\u043d\u043e\u043c\u0443 \u0442\u0430 \u0441\u044e\u0436\u0435\u0442\u043d\u043e\u043c\u0443 \u043e\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u043d\u044f\u0445.\",\"Ha pasado un mes desde el lanzamiento en acceso anticipado: cuento qu\u00e9 se ha arreglado, en qu\u00e9 estoy trabajando y qu\u00e9 llegar\u00e1 en las grandes actualizaciones t\u00e9cnica y de historia.\",null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[\"84f35c490628b0e96bde88f53306114b2039b47a.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"4c13f082e79eea2c023320b31309b1b428f3251f.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[],\"library_spotlight\":true}","announcement_body":{"gid":"706660627797511164","clanid":"45953766","posterid":"0","headline":"A month after the EA release \u2014 what's done and what's next \ud83c\udf3e","posttime":1792684799,"updatetime":1792684799,"body":"[h3]Hi everyone![\/h3][p]It's been a month since The Headlands launched into Early Access. Time to talk about what's changed and where things are heading.[\/p][p]But first \u2014 thank you. You haven't been standing on the sidelines: you write reviews, send bug reports, suggest ideas, argue in the discussions about which machinery is missing, and share your impressions of the game. Almost everything I'm about to describe grew out of that. And if you've enjoyed the game but haven't left a review on the store page yet \u2014 please do. For a small indie game, reviews affect whether other people get to see it at all: it's a few minutes of your time, but it helps enormously \ud83d\ude4f[\/p][p][\/p][h3][b]What's already done[\/b][\/h3][p]The first week after release went into updates \u2014 almost all of it grew out of your bug reports.[\/p][p]The biggest job was the [b]save system[\/b]: saves are now hundreds of times smaller and faster, a corrupted file no longer breaks your progress, and every slot now has a history you can roll back to any earlier point from \u2014 even when nothing's broken.[\/p][p]I also evened out the [b]balance[\/b]: rewards for story contracts (some were well below market value, some well above) and class 3 tractors \u2014 Trempel isn't helpless anymore.[\/p][p]The rest is a pile of fixes for trucks, contracts and machinery, all written up in the patch notes:[\/p][list][*][p][url=\"https:\/\/store.steampowered.com\/news\/app\/4301110\/view\/680761125088790295\"]Update - The Headlands \u2013 ea.0.22.5[\/url][\/p][\/*][*][p][url=\"https:\/\/store.steampowered.com\/news\/app\/4301110\/view\/678509959027097787\"]Update - The Headlands \u2013 ea.0.22.6[\/url][\/p][\/*][*][p][url=\"https:\/\/store.steampowered.com\/news\/app\/4301110\/view\/678509959027097871\"]Update - The Headlands \u2013 ea.0.22.7[\/url][\/p][\/*][*][p][url=\"https:\/\/store.steampowered.com\/news\/app\/4301110\/view\/678509959027098948\"]Update - The Headlands \u2013 ea.0.22.8[\/url][\/p][\/*][\/list][p]One more thing: [b]Steam Cloud[\/b] has been working in the game for a while now \u2014 I'm sure some of you have already noticed and tried it. Achievements are next in line, I'm finalising the list right now.[\/p][p][\/p][h3][b]The new routing grid.[\/b][\/h3][p]After that I sat down to the biggest thing currently in the works \u2014 reworking the routing logic with a new route grid.[\/p][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/45953766\/cfbd63b1fa8483ea84feb59a094855d1dde112a3.png\"][\/img][\/p][p]It opens up things that simply weren't possible before:[\/p][list][*][p][b]Field-to-field routes[\/b] \u2014 without returning to the farm[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]A next task for vehicles[\/b] \u2014 a tractor will remember what to do after its current job[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]Paths that can be unlocked[\/b] \u2014 building bridges, clearing overgrown sections and the like[\/p][\/*][\/list][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/45953766\/8efe59c573c105fada496d84dc8f7cc7a96ffcf9.png\"][\/img][\/p][h3][b]Trucks[\/b][\/h3][p]A few logic updates: among them, the option to add a second truck to a harvest. After that \u2014 separate truck tasks for delivering and selling resources.[\/p][h3][b]New contracts[\/b][\/h3][p]There will be contracts for spraying and for planting and harvesting vegetables. I also really want to completely rework delivery contracts so that trucks are actually used in them \u2014 but even though the new routing grid makes that much easier, it's still a big chunk of work, so no promises on timing yet.[\/p][h3][b]New machinery[\/b][\/h3][p]Already done: the new [b]LZHT-6 \"Titan\"[\/b] harvester and a fully reworked [b]LZHT-5 \"Zhaivir\"[\/b]. On top of that, several new trucks and tractors are already queued up.[\/p][p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/45953766\/c96da8b4c24c6a9954d10a6128477b05fe62a1a7.png\"][\/img][\/p][h3][b]Balance and buildings[\/b][\/h3][p]There are a lot of requests to revisit the balance, especially building capacity and repair costs. I'm working on it, and suggestions are still very welcome \ud83d\udc9b For example, many players suggested adding presets for wear speed \u2014 slow\/medium\/fast \u2014 and putting them in the settings.[\/p][h3][b]More story[\/b][\/h3][p]And of course, there's no doing without story updates \ud83d\ude09 The second part of Traktorivka's story is coming, with familiar characters who'll have new troubles and new achievements they'll definitely want to share. I'm also planning to expand and deepen the production chain mechanics as part of the story.[\/p][h3][b]When?[\/b][\/h3][p]The big technical update is planned for [b]November[\/b], the story one roughly for [b]December[\/b]. What exactly goes into each \u2014 I'll tell you closer to the time, once it's ready \ud83d\ude0a[\/p][h3][b]Discord[\/b][\/h3][p]A lot of you asked, I resisted for a long time, but here it finally is \ud83d\ude42[\/p][p]Besides talking about the game, you can create bug reports and content requests there (and vote on existing suggestions). If it catches on, I'll take the vote counts into account when deciding which machinery to make next. The Steam discussions aren't going anywhere \u2014 I still read all of them.[\/p][p][url=\"https:\/\/discord.gg\/6QFhYgyCCT\"]DISCORD[\/url][\/p][h3][b]And finally[\/b][\/h3][p]There's still plenty of work ahead \u2014 write what you'd like to see in the game, and don't hesitate to complain when something doesn't work right.[\/p][p]See you in the fields \ud83c\udf3e\ud83d\ude9c[\/p]","commentcount":18,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_1827889981_1792687009_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"574930338697075124","event_gid":"706660627797511163","voteupcount":206,"votedowncount":1,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"574930338697075124","rtime32_last_modified":1794043724,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1792687009,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1792601616,"votes_up":206,"votes_down":1,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"565911090118345775","gidfeature2":"574930338697075124"},{"gid":"680761125088789649","clan_steamid":"103582791475475174","event_name":"The Headlands is out in Early Access! \ud83c\udf3e","event_type":14,"appid":4301110,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1789394400,"rtime32_end_time":1789399801,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"The Headlands is now available in Early Access \u2014 the first part of Traktorivka's story is waiting for you.\",\"The Headlands ist jetzt im Early Access verf\u00fcgbar \u2014 der erste Teil der Geschichte von Traktoriwka wartet auf euch.\",\"The Headlands est d\u00e9sormais disponible en acc\u00e8s anticip\u00e9 \u2014 la premi\u00e8re partie de l'histoire de Traktorivka vous attend.\",\"The Headlands \u00e8 ora disponibile in accesso anticipato \u2014 la prima parte della storia di Traktorivka vi aspetta.\",null,\"The Headlands ya est\u00e1 disponible en acceso anticipado \u2014 la primera parte de la historia de Traktorivka os espera.\",null,null,null,null,null,\"The Headlands j\u00e1 est\u00e1 dispon\u00edvel em acesso antecipado \u2014 a primeira parte da hist\u00f3ria de Traktorivka espera por voc\u00eas.\",\"The Headlands jest ju\u017c dost\u0119pne we wczesnym dost\u0119pie \u2014 pierwsza cz\u0119\u015b\u0107 historii Traktoriwki czeka na was.\",null,null,null,null,null,\"A The Headlands mostant\u00f3l el\u00e9rhet\u0151 korai hozz\u00e1f\u00e9r\u00e9sben \u2014 Traktorivka t\u00f6rt\u00e9net\u00e9nek els\u0151 r\u00e9sze m\u00e1r v\u00e1r r\u00e1tok.\",\"The Headlands je nyn\u00ed dostupn\u00e1 v p\u0159edb\u011b\u017en\u00e9m p\u0159\u00edstupu \u2014 prvn\u00ed \u010d\u00e1st p\u0159\u00edb\u011bhu Traktorivky u\u017e na v\u00e1s \u010dek\u00e1.\",\"The Headlands este acum disponibil \u00een acces timpuriu \u2014 prima parte a pove\u0219tii din Traktorivka v\u0103 a\u0219teapt\u0103.\",\"The Headlands art\u0131k erken eri\u015fimde \u2014 Traktorivka hik\u00e2yesinin ilk b\u00f6l\u00fcm\u00fc sizi bekliyor.\",null,null,null,null,\"The Headlands \u0434\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0443\u043f\u043d\u0430 \u0432 \u0440\u0430\u043d\u043d\u044c\u043e\u043c\u0443 \u0434\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0443\u043f\u0456 \u2014 \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0448\u0430 \u0447\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0438\u043d\u0430 \u0456\u0441\u0442\u043e\u0440\u0456\u0457 \u0422\u0440\u0430\u043a\u0442\u043e\u0440\u0456\u0432\u043a\u0438 \u0432\u0436\u0435 \u0447\u0435\u043a\u0430\u0454 \u043d\u0430 \u0432\u0430\u0441.\",\"The Headlands ya est\u00e1 disponible en acceso anticipado \u2014 la primera parte de la historia de Traktorivka os espera.\",null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[null,null,null,\"\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"\",\"\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[\"af83ecaca9b2e8bdf319b9b0c2db0396b2245fcd.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"34315df274f7e7fbb558831f2375974ff91a9a0f.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[],\"library_spotlight\":true}","announcement_body":{"gid":"680761125088789650","clanid":"45953766","posterid":"0","headline":"The Headlands is out in Early Access! \ud83c\udf3e","posttime":1789394410,"updatetime":1789472650,"body":"[p]Hi everyone![\/p][p]Well then - The Headlands is out in Early Access![\/p][previewyoutube=\"7NSXBnP6Q2w;full\"][\/previewyoutube][p]First of all - thank you. To everyone who wishlisted the game, played the demo, shared feedback, reported bugs, shared ideas, made content, and stuck around these past months. The game made it to this day because of you, and that's not just a figure of speech - half of what's in the game right now exists because of your comments.[\/p][p]What's available now is the first part of Traktorivka's story: a farm to rebuild from the ground up, villagers with their own business and their own personalities, and a whole village that gradually opens up beyond your own field.[\/p][p]The Headlands will keep growing - and where exactly it goes depends on you. So keep writing: feedback, ideas, wishes, complaints - all of it genuinely shapes what the game becomes.[\/p][p]Have fun! See you in the fields \ud83c\udf3e\ud83d\ude9c[\/p]","commentcount":45,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_1827889981_1789394561_0","ModAct_1415716708_1789474701_4"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"500617547938362203","event_gid":"680761125088789649","voteupcount":176,"votedowncount":2,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":1789394400,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"500617547938362203","rtime32_last_modified":1792702449,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1789474702,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1789392518,"votes_up":176,"votes_down":2,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"565911090118345775","gidfeature2":"500617547938362203"},{"gid":"678509959027098948","clan_steamid":"103582791475475174","event_name":"Update - The Headlands \u2013 ea.0.22.8","event_type":12,"appid":4301110,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1790101796,"rtime32_end_time":0,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"[]","announcement_body":{"gid":"678509959027098949","clanid":"45953766","posterid":"0","headline":"Update - The Headlands \u2013 ea.0.22.8","posttime":1790101796,"updatetime":1790101796,"body":"[h1]Update - The Headlands \u2013 ea.0.22.8[\/h1]\n\nSave system overhaul today and some balance tweaks. \n\nA lot was changed under the hood. All existing saves carry over automatically - no need to start over, the game migrates them the first time you launch.\nTested it a lot and the transition must be smooth. But if something breaks in your specific case - I'm always here!\n\n[h2]New[\/h2]\n[list]\n[*] Adjustable autosave interval (5 \/ 10 \/ 15 \/ 20 \/ 30 \/ 60 min, or Off)\n[*] Per-slot save history: a small button next to each slot opens a list of previous saves - roll back your progress anytime, even if nothing's broken\n[*] Manual and automatic saves no longer overwrite each other.\n[*] Added \"delete save\" button in save history panel\n[*] Game saves on new day start (only if autosave is enabled)\n[\/list]\n\n[h2]Improvements[\/h2]\n[list]\n[*] Save file significantly reduced in size (10MB => 60KB). Way less disk space, faster loading, faster saving.\n[*] A corrupted save now falls back to the last good one instead of just failing\n[*] Fixed a few cases where fresh progress (selling crops, contract progress) could slip past autosave\n[*] The \"Continue\" button now shows exactly which slot and when it was last saved\n[*] Game knows when the last save was and warns you on exit\n[*] Autosave count is reduced to 10 saves that are used in cycle\n[*] Some preparations for cloud save integration.\n[*] Tuned some contract rewards. Some story contracts were way below market value, others were way above. \n[*] Tweaked Class-3 tractors. Trempel is not useless anymore, Boar is balanced.\n[*] Reduced Kivi's wear intensity.\n[\/list]\n\nAs always - thanks for playing and reporting issues!","commentcount":15,"tags":["patchnotes","mod_reviewed","ModAct_1889321037_1790101936_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"564794422009802892","event_gid":"678509959027098948","voteupcount":105,"votedowncount":1,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"564794422009802892","rtime32_last_modified":1793042666,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1790101936,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1790101796,"votes_up":105,"votes_down":1,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"565911090118345775","gidfeature2":"564794422009802892"}],"EventWebRowEmbed":{"bPreLoaded":true,"announcementGIDList":["706660627797511164","680761125088789650"],"last_update_event":{"rtime":1790101796,"event_gid":"678509959027098948","announcement_gid":"678509959027098949","clan_account_id":45953766}}};
						</script>
					

